.TH SPACEGL_3DVIEW 1 "2026-04-19" "SpaceGL @VERSION@" "SpaceGL Manual"
.SH NAME
spacegl_3dview \- SpaceGL OpenGL 3D rendering frontend
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B spacegl_3dview
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B spacegl_3dview
is the OpenGL/GLFW-based 3D rendering frontend for the SpaceGL engine.
It reads galaxy state from shared memory (SHM) written by
.BR spacegl_server (1)
and renders ships, torpedoes, and galactic objects in real time using
hardware-accelerated OpenGL.
.PP
This binary is typically launched automatically by
.BR spacegl_client (1)
when the
.B gl
argument is specified. It can also be started independently to attach
to an existing shared memory segment.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-screenshot " FILE"
Capture frame N (see below) as a binary PPM and exit. The clock of the
viewer is then fixed (one frame = 1/60 s), so the frame is the same picture
on every run; a missing shared-memory segment is created empty (the scene
of the golden render) instead of waited for.
.TP
.BI \-\-screenshot\-frame " N"
The frame to capture (default 30).
.TP
.BI \-\-seed " N"
Fixed random seed (deterministic starfield).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-rotate
No automatic camera orbit.
.TP
.BI \-\-window " WxH"
Window size.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DISPLAY
X11 display for the OpenGL output.
.TP
.B SPACEGL_GL_BLOOM
.B full
(default): the bloom blur at the window size, six passes;
.BR half :
at half the size in each direction, two passes (about a seventh of the
blur cost, a slightly softer halo on thin bright lines);
.BR off :
no bloom (the scene at about half the brightness, the bloom adding a
blurred copy of it).
.TP
.B SPACEGL_GL_PROFILE
Set to 1 to print a draw-call profile every 300 frames: the time of a
frame before the swap and of each phase (sky, backdrop, objects, effects,
bloom, HUD; every phase waits for the GL to finish, only while profiling)
and the glut shapes drawn per frame, replayed from display lists or
tessellated in immediate mode.
.TP
.B SPACEGL_GL_PROFILE_FRAMES
With the profile on: print it and exit after this many frames.
.TP
.B SPACEGL_GL_SHAPE_CACHE
Set to 0 to draw every shape in immediate mode instead of replaying it
from a display list (for comparisons).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/bin/spacegl_3dview
OpenGL viewer executable.
.SH SEE ALSO
